ood report leads with the result and the decision: *\"Instagram ads brought 34 orders at ₦1,900 each, below our ₦3,000 limit. Recommendation: increase the budget by 30% next month.\"* Not 20 screenshots of charts.\n\n## Careers and earning\n\n- **Certifications** (free or low cost): Google Digital Garage and Google Skillshop (Google Ads, Analytics), Meta Blueprint, HubSpot Academy (inbound, content and email marketing), Semrush Academy (SEO).\n- **Portfolio**: real results for real businesses. Start with a family business, a church, a friend's shop: document the before, what you did and the after. Your final project in this course is a portfolio piece.\n- **Freelancing**: small businesses everywhere need help with Google Business Profiles, social media management, ads and SEO. Package your service clearly, with a monthly price and a report.\n- **Jobs**: digital marketing executive, social media manager, SEO specialist, paid media specialist, content marketer, marketing analyst.\n\n## Practise\n\nUse the tutor to draft a 90-day plan.","practice":"Tell the tutor about a real business and its current situation. Ask it to help you write a one-page 90-day marketing plan: a SMART goal, the persona in two lines, 3 channels with reasons, a budget split, a week-by-week outline for the first month, and 4 KPIs with targets. Then ask it to play a sceptical business owner and challenge your plan with 3 tough questions."}$cdm$::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set body = excluded.body, track = excluded.track, updated_at = now();
